What number belongs in the blank part of this area model?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4,1.5);
\draw (2.5,0)--(2.5,1.5);
\node[above] at (1.25,1.5) {$50$};
\node[above] at (3.25,1.5) {$7$};
\node[left] at (0,0.75) {$8$};
\node at (1.25,0.75) {$400$};
\node at (3.25,0.75) {$?$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
